usage: actenon-kernel [-h]
                      {up,doctor,simulate,verify-proof,verify-receipt,verify-refusal,attest-receipt,attest-refusal,verify-receipt-attestation,verify-refusal-attestation,evidence,keys,graph,bundle,preflight,mcp,scan,conformance,coverage}
                      ...

Kernel CLI for bootstrapping the single-node trust runtime, verifying proof,
generating local key material, creating execution anchors, publishing key-
discovery documents, querying execution evidence, scanning execution gaps,
running coverage matrices, validating artifacts, and running conformance. The
unified developer CLI `actenon` is provided by the actenon-permit package.

positional arguments:
  {up,doctor,simulate,verify-proof,verify-receipt,verify-refusal,attest-receipt,attest-refusal,verify-receipt-attestation,verify-refusal-attestation,evidence,keys,graph,bundle,preflight,mcp,scan,conformance,coverage}
    up                  Start the local single-node trust runtime server and
                        local trace viewer.
    doctor              Check whether the local single-node trust runtime is
                        healthy and complete.
    simulate            Run local incident simulations that contrast
                        unprotected execution, proof checks, and protected-
                        endpoint runtime behavior.
    verify-proof        Verify an Action Intent and PCCB pair against explicit
                        verifier context.
    verify-receipt      Validate a receipt artifact and optional linked
                        artifacts.
    verify-refusal      Validate a refusal artifact and optional linked
                        artifacts.
    attest-receipt      Create an opt-in signed attestation envelope for a
                        receipt.
    attest-refusal      Create an opt-in signed attestation envelope for a
                        refusal.
    verify-receipt-attestation
                        Verify a signed receipt attestation envelope.
    verify-refusal-attestation
                        Verify a signed refusal attestation envelope.
    evidence            Query local execution evidence artifacts and receipt
                        chains.
    keys                Generate local key material or publishable key-
                        discovery documents.
    graph               Create local execution anchors and optionally request
                        publication.
    bundle              Export the local single-node runtime as a portable
                        local bundle.
    preflight           Ask Actenon before a consequential action executes.
    mcp                 Inspect local MCP proof-gate wrapper patterns.
    scan                Run the local execution-gap scanner against a repo,
                        MCP tools, endpoints, artifacts, or the built-in local
                        harness.
    conformance         Run local open-source conformance checks.
    coverage            Run local deterministic coverage matrices for proof-
                        bound consequential actions.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
